195	         * HS_FLAG_ALLOWEMPTY is a compile flag where empty strings are allowed to match.
196	         * HS_FLAG_UTF8 is a flag where UTF8 literals are matched.
197	         * HS_FLAG_SINGLEMATCH is a compile flag where each pattern match will be returned only once. it is a good performance practice
198	         * as it is said in the Hyperscan documentation. https://intel.github.io/hyperscan/dev-reference/performance.html#single-match-flag
